    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618380/extras/6a42bc205b738f0e1f81610c1758c873.avif?t=1742634388\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br>Sawyer and her friends arrive at a ruined factory to prepare an event. While everyone\u2019s busy, Sawyer experiences something strange inside the building.<br>Sometime later, Huck Finn, Sawyer\u2019s boyfriend, arrives at the factory with some friends after receiving a text message from her...<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618380/extras/89ab79e9ea2612441952b3bf239ee42e.avif?t=1742634388\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An RPG Maker style adventure game with real time combat - clear your path with your trusty Steel Pipe. Enhance yourself and your weapons with items found on your adventure.<br></li><li>Beautiful illustrations and pixel sprites - Enjoy tens of pictures made by the main artists LuB2an and Coinman.<br></li><li>Moody piano music - 22 soundtrack pieces written by the artist Antler and the developer Gustav</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618380/extras/6a42bc205b738f0e1f81610c1758c873.avif?t=1742634388\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br>Sawyer and her friends arrive at a ruined factory to prepare an event. While everyone\u2019s busy, Sawyer experiences something strange inside the building.<br>Sometime later, Huck Finn, Sawyer\u2019s boyfriend, arrives at the factory with some friends after receiving a text message from her...<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618380/extras/89ab79e9ea2612441952b3bf239ee42e.avif?t=1742634388\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An RPG Maker style adventure game with real time combat - clear your path with your trusty Steel Pipe. Enhance yourself and your weapons with items found on your adventure.<br></li><li>Beautiful illustrations and pixel sprites - Enjoy tens of pictures made by the main artists LuB2an and Coinman.<br></li><li>Moody piano music - 22 soundtrack pieces written by the artist Antler and the developer Gustav</li></ul>",
